    {
      "id": "hv-1",
      "conflict": "Technological stagnation versus the loss of human agency as the primary existential risk.",
      "prevails": "undecidable",
      "criterion": "scope",
      "rationale": "This disagreement rests on subjective value judgments regarding whether the risk of losing control outweighs the risk of failing to innovate. Both sides identify valid existential threats, but they prioritize different catastrophic outcomes without a shared metric for harm.",
